    "title": "Severe Thunderstorm Warning issued for parts of West TN - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By WBBJ Staff ,\n13 hours ago The National Weather Service in Memphis has issued a Severe Thunderstorm Warning for southeastern Crockett County, northeastern Fayette County, northwestern Hardeman County, Haywood County and western Madison County. At 10:47 a.m, a severe thunderstorm was located 8 miles northwest of Dancyville, or 12 miles southwest of Brownsville, moving east at... Read full article\nRead in NewsBreak 1",
